// =============================================================================
// DEPRECATED: Agent Service v1 - Core VM Operations on Hypervisor Nodes
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Provides VM-centric operations that run on agent/hypervisor nodes.
// These are the "local" operations that interact directly with libvirt/qemu.
//
// DEPRECATED: All features have been migrated to agent/v2/agent_service.proto
// - Migration: VmMigrate -> agent/v2/InitiateMigration
// - IP retrieval: VmIpList -> agent/v2/GetVMGuestIPs
// - Password change: VmChangeUserPassword -> agent/v2/ChangeVMUserPassword
// - Backup/Restore: VmBackupSystemVolume, VmRestoreSystemVolume -> Not yet in v2
// - Cloud-init: VmAttachCloudInit -> agent/v2/AttachCloudInit
// - Network interfaces: VmAttachNetworkInterface, VmDetachNetworkInterface -> agent/v2
// - Streaming: Stream -> agent/v2/Stream
// - Hardware: GetHardwareHealth, GetSensorData -> agent/v2
//
// Communication: Primarily unary RPC (some streaming for VNC/terminal)
//
// Key Operations (deprecated):
// - VM migration between hosts (live or cold)
// - IP address retrieval via qemu-guest-agent
// - Password changes via qemu-guest-agent
// - System volume backup/restore
// - Cloud-init ISO attachment
// - Network interface attach/detach
// - VNC/terminal streaming (bidirectional)
// - Hardware health monitoring
// =============================================================================

